========== 第2章: /etc/localtime がコピーのとき（C ライブラリは読むが timedatectl はゾーン名を出せない） ==========

$ cp --remove-destination /usr/share/zoneinfo/Asia/Tokyo /etc/localtime

$ ls -l /etc/localtime
-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 309 Oct 13 11:43 /etc/localtime

$ timedatectl | grep "Time zone"
                Time zone: n/a (UTC, +0000)

$ env -u TZ date
Tue Oct 13 11:43:18 JST 2026

$ timedatectl set-timezone Etc/UTC

$ ls -l /etc/localtime
lrwxrwxrwx 1 root root 27 Oct 13 11:43 /etc/localtime -> /usr/share/zoneinfo/Etc/UTC


========== 第3章: chronyd が時計を動かさないのは -x のため ==========

$ cat /etc/default/chrony
DAEMON_OPTS="-F -1 -x"

$ systemctl cat chrony.service | grep ExecStart
ExecStart=!/usr/lib/systemd/scripts/chronyd-starter.sh $DAEMON_OPTS

$ grep -n -B1 -A2 'by default we enable -x' /usr/share/doc/chrony/README.container
13-
14:In a container the first makes (usually) no sense, so by default we enable -x
15-there (as it would only crash otherwise).
16-This will disable the control of the system clock.

$ man 8 chronyd 2>/dev/null | grep -A3 -E '^ +-x$'
       -x
           This option disables the control of the system clock. chronyd will
           not try to make any adjustments of the clock. It will assume the
           clock is free running and still track its offset and frequency

$ journalctl --no-pager -u chrony | grep "control of system clock"
Oct 13 11:43:16 linuc chronyd[90]: Disabled control of system clock


========== 第3章: パッケージの既定（一覧を取ってから .deb の中を見る） ==========

$ apt-get update > /dev/null 2>&1; echo "apt-get update: exit=$?"
apt-get update: exit=0

$ cd /tmp && apt-get download chrony ntpsec > /dev/null 2>&1; ls /tmp/*.deb; cd /root
/tmp/chrony_4.5-1ubuntu4.2_amd64.deb
/tmp/ntpsec_1.2.2+dfsg1-4build2_amd64.deb

$ dpkg-deb --fsys-tarfile /tmp/chrony_*.deb | tar -xO ./etc/default/chrony
# This is a configuration file for /etc/init.d/chrony and
# /lib/systemd/system/chrony.service; it allows you to pass various options to
# the chrony daemon without editing the init script or service file.

# Options to pass to chrony.
DAEMON_OPTS="-F 1"

# Sync system clock in containers or without CAP_SYS_TIME (likely to fail)
# See /usr/share/doc/chrony/README.container for details.
SYNC_IN_CONTAINER="no"

$ dpkg-deb -c /tmp/ntpsec_*.deb | grep 'ntp.conf'
-rw-r--r-- root/root      1957 2024-04-01 16:02 ./etc/ntpsec/ntp.conf
-rw-r--r-- root/root     21127 2024-04-01 16:02 ./usr/share/man/man5/ntp.conf.5.gz

$ apt-cache show systemd-timesyncd | grep -E '^(Package|Provides|Conflicts):'
Package: systemd-timesyncd
Provides: time-daemon
Conflicts: time-daemon
Package: systemd-timesyncd
Provides: time-daemon
Conflicts: time-daemon


